4. Fix some bugs:
	- Improve the security check logic for application class loader settings in Tester.
	- Add text boundary safety checks to TextAreaTab to prevent array out-of-bounds errors.

-----------------
WIKI: https://i-hope1.github.io/mod-tools
'''
